cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RobustEHR in your research, please cite it."
title: "RobustEHR: deterministic, dose-calibrated perturbation of clinical free text"
abstract: >-
  Measurement infrastructure for clinical NLP robustness studies. Names a
  versioned operator, reports realized dose against an explicit eligible unit,
  measures whether an edit touched clinical evidence rather than assuming it,
  and publishes edit scripts so a corrupted corpus can be regenerated
  byte-identically from the original notes without redistributing them.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Open Health Data Lab"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/open-health-data-lab/RobustEHR"
url: "https://github.com/open-health-data-lab/RobustEHR"
keywords:
  - clinical-nlp
  - robustness
  - perturbation
  - electronic-health-records
  - umls
  - reproducibility
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
